        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Think Like a Man, Act Like a Lady, Think Like a Man, The Steve Harvey Morning Show, Steve Harvey, Family Feud, Little Big Shots, Steve Harvey's Funderdome\n- People: Tim Story, Keith Marryman, David A. Newman, Steve Harvey\n- Topics: film adaptations, hosting roles\n\nFacts:\n- In 2009, Steve Harvey published the book \"Act Like a Lady, Think Like a Man\".\n- In 2012, the American romantic comedy film \"Think Like a Man\" was directed by Tim Story and written by Keith Marryman and David A. Newman.\n- The 2012 film \"Think Like a Man\" was based on Steve Harvey's 2009 book \"Act Like a Lady, Think Like a Man\".\n- Steve Harvey hosts \"The Steve Harvey Morning Show\".\n- Steve Harvey hosts the talk show \"Steve Harvey\".\n- Steve Harvey hosts \"Family Feud\".\n- Steve Harvey hosts \"Little Big Shots\" and its spinoff.\n- Steve Harvey hosts \"Steve Harvey's Funderdome\".",
